                <span style="cursor:pointer; color:#5a5a7a;" onclick="kisilerEkraninaDonSol()"><i class="fas fa-arrow-left"></i></span>
                <span id="sohbetHedefAdSol" style="font-weight:600; color:white;">Kullanıcı</span>
